    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d113-f1" n="1" xml:id="d113-f1-content">
                <p>The statement is printed as attachment 2 to Secretary Humphrey’s letter of Jan.
                    7, 1954, <ref target="#pg356">p. 356</ref>; it was approved without change by
                    the NAC.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
